---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>关于 | Marinus's Blog</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-color: #FAFAFB;
        --text-main: #2C2C2C;
        --text-muted: #888888;
        --text-lighter: #999999;
        --border-color: #EEEEEE;
        --radius: 12px;
        --type-nav-size: 0.95rem;
        --type-nav-spacing: 0;
        --accent: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
      }

      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        background: var(--bg-color);
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
        color: var(--text-main);
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .blog-container {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 32px;
      }

      /* Site Header */
      .site-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 40px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        margin-bottom: 40px;
      }

      .site-brand {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      .site-nav {
        display: flex;
        gap: 24px;
        font-size: var(--type-nav-size);
        letter-spacing: var(--type-nav-spacing);
        color: var(--text-muted);
      }

      .site-nav a:hover {
        color: var(--text-main);
      }
      
      .site-nav a.active {
        color: var(--text-main);
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      /* About Content */
      .page-title {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
        color: var(--text-main);
      }

      .about-content {
        margin-bottom: 60px;
      }

      .about-content h2 {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        margin: 40px 0 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        padding-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .about-content p {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: var(--text-main);
      }

      .about-card {
        background: var(--accent);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        padding: 32px;
        margin: 40px 0;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 24px;
      }

      .avatar {
        width: 80px;
        height: 80px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #ddd;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 2rem;
        color: #fff;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .avatar img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }

      .card-info h3 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .card-info p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      /* Footer */
      .site-footer {
        margin-top: 80px;
        padding-top: 30px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        padding-bottom: 60px;
      }

      .footer-links {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 20px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .footer-links a {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        transition: color 0.2s ease;
      }

      .footer-links a:hover {
        color: var(--text-main);
      }

      .footer-desc {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        margin-top: 12px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .blog-container {
          padding: 0 20px;
        }
        .about-card {
          flex-direction: column;
          text-align: center;
          padding: 24px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="blog-container">
      <header class="site-header">
        <div class="site-brand"><a href="/">Marinus's Blog</a></div>
        <nav class="site-nav">
          <a href="/">首页</a>
          <a href="/gallery">画集</a>
          <a href="/archive">归档</a>
          <a href="/about" class="active">关于</a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <main class="main-content">
        <h1 class="page-title">关于我</h1>

        <section class="about-card">
          <div class="avatar">
            <img src="/avatar.jpg" alt="Marinus" /> 
          </div>
          <div class="card-info">
            <h3>Marinus</h3>
            <p>记录代码留下的痕迹，思考设计在工程中的边界。</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-content">
          <p>你好，我是 Marinus。</p>
          <p>欢迎来到我的个人博客。这里主要是我记录生活见闻的自留地。在这个充满噪音的时代，我希望能通过文字保留一些有价值的思考与痕迹。</p>

          <h2>网站理念</h2>
          <p>本站基于 <strong>Astro</strong> 构建。我崇尚极简主义的排版流，没有引入臃肿的样式框架，只为呈现最纯粹的阅读体验。</p>


          <h2>联系方式</h2>
          <p>如果你发现文章有误，或者对博客的构建方式感兴趣，欢迎通过以下方式与我交流探讨：</p>
          <p>Email: <a href="mailto:marinusCr@outlook.com" style="text-decoration: underline; color: var(--text-muted); text-underline-offset: 4px;">MarinusCr@outlook.com</a></p>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer class="site-footer">
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/M-Crowe" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            GitHub
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:marinusCr@outlook.com">Email</a>
        </div>
        <p class="footer-desc">
          © 2026 Marinus's Blog. Built with Astro & Pretext.<br/>
          记录技术、设计与生活的美好时刻。
        </p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>